<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">grenadier</ansi>

The Grenadier is the neutral elite of the Bombardier (Alchemist route; no
alignment asked). Its Fire Flask bursts over four foes, then five (a whole
company), and burns hotter at every other rank.

<ansi fg="yellow-bold">Ranks</ansi>

  30 Grenado            Fire Flask reaches two more foes (four in all)
  35 Hotter still       Fire Flask burns at 112% of Sparks
  40 Bandolier          +8 flasks in the satchel (in all)
  45 Barrage            Fire Flask reaches three more foes (five in all, a
                        whole company)
  50 White fire         Fire Flask burns at 126% of Sparks
  55 Sapper's frame     +10% maximum health
  60 Arsenal            +12 flasks in the satchel (in all), and Fire Flask
                        burns at 140% of Sparks

It needs the Bombardier first (<ansi fg="command">help alchemist-routes</ansi>) and keeps every rank of it. At level 30 a
character that holds it promotes with <ansi fg="command">class promote [member] grenadier confirm</ansi>. Any alignment may take it.
Everything here lasts only for the battle and is never saved.

<ansi fg="yellow-bold">Elite talents</ansi>

Elite Alchemist talents (levels 35, 45, 55): Iron Hide (+5 Armor), Master
Brewer (+4 flasks in the satchel), Potent Flasks (Healing Draught heals 15%
more and Fire Flask burns 15% harder). See <ansi fg="command">help
talents</ansi>.

See also: <ansi fg="command">help alchemist-routes</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help alchemist</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help elite</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help promotion</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help talents</ansi>.
